msgstr ""

#: dat/events/neutral/capella_ghost.lua:30
msgid "Starlighter"
msgstr ""

#. ghost:setNoRender()
#. Pew pew is beneath us here
#: dat/events/neutral/capella_ghost.lua:61
msgid ""
"As you're getting your bearings after the hyperspace jump, an eerie feeling "
"washes over you. There's something peculiar about this place, and the sensor "
"feeds confirm it is anything but mundane."
msgstr ""

#: dat/events/neutral/capella_ghost.lua:63
msgid ""
"\"There are several abnormalities in the ambient radiation and gravitational "
"readings. Also, a system with this many stars would not be statistically "
"possible under ordinary physics.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/events/neutral/capella_ghost.lua:64
msgid ""
"\"Something almost like another ship is nearby, but I am unable to pinpoint "
"the exact location, nor assess how much danger we could be in. I would "
"suggest flying in stealth mode and exercising heavy caution as long as we "
"are here."
msgstr ""

#: dat/events/neutral/capella_ghost.lua:65
msgid ""
"You can feel a presence start to stir against your very being, as if you "
"were being watched. It may not be wise to linger."
msgstr ""

