msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/dvaered/recruitment/dv_bikers.lua:135
msgid ""
"A Dvaered Warlord needs you to perform a tiny special task for the Baron "
"Sauterfeldt. Only the Baron knows what that task is."
msgstr ""

