#. --
#.
#.
#. Collective Scout
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Starts the collective mini campaign.
#.
#. You must inspect a stray drone.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Non-persistent state
#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:50
#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:60
msgid "Lt. Commander"
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:50
msgid ""
"You see an Empire Lt. Commander who seems to be motioning you over to the "
"counter."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:62
msgid ""
"You approach the Lt. Commander.\n"
"\"Hello, {player}; we have a reconnaissance mission you might be interested "
"in. Commander Soldner said you'd make a good candidate for the mission. You "
"up for the challenge?\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:74
msgid ""
"\"I don't think we've met. I'm Lt. Commander Dimitri. If all goes well, "
"you'll be reporting to me for the next assignments.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:75
msgid ""
"\"You've heard about the Collective, right? From what we know, the "
"Collective seems to be a sort of 'hive' of robots. They're a recent menace; "
"had the timing to arrive more or less when the Incident occurred, otherwise "
"they would have been wiped out by the Emperor's Armada without a sweat.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:76
msgid ""
"\"They completely wiped out all human life on {planet} and the other worlds "
"they hit. We managed to stop them here, in {sys}, and constructed this base. "
"Since then, it's been more or less a stalemate.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:77
msgid ""
"Lt. Commander Dimitri informed you about the Collective, a \"hive\" of "
"robotic drones that have been menacing the {sys} system."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:78
msgid ""
"\"Collective activity has increased heavily the last few decaperiods. We've "
"been trying to contain them, but a scout broke through to the jump point. It "
"was last detected by a patrol in {misn_nearby}, which saw it jumping out to "
"{misn_target}.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:79
msgid ""
"\"You are to locate the scout and report back to {pnt} in the {sys} system. "
"It seems like the Collective is planning something, and we want to follow "
"their game a little more closely.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec00.lua:80
msgid ""
"\"It is of vital importance that you do not engage the drone. Report back as "
"soon as you locate it.\""
msgstr ""

