#.
#. <?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf8'?>
#. <mission name="Collective Espionage 1">
#. <unique />
#. <priority>2</priority>
#. <cond>faction.reputationGlobal("Empire") &gt; 5 and var.peek("collective_fail") ~= true</cond>
#. <done>Collective Scouting</done>
#. <chance>100</chance>
#. <location>Bar</location>
#. <spob>Omega Enclave</spob>
#. <notes>
#. <campaign>Collective</campaign>
#. </notes>
#. </mission>
#. --
#.
#.
#. Collective Espionage I
#.
#. Author: bobbens
#. minor edits by Infiltrator
#. converted to VN framework by MageKing17
#.
#. Second mission in the mini collective campaign.
#.
#. You must inspect a system for wireless communications.
#.
#.
#.
#. Mission constants
#. Note: this mission does not make any system claims.
#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec01.lua:42
msgid "You notice Lt. Commander Dimitri motioning for you to come over to him."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec01.lua:53
msgid ""
"You meet up with Lt. Commander Dimitri.\n"
"\"We managed to capture the drone after you located it. It didn't seem to be "
"in good health. Our scientists are studying it as we speak, but we've found "
"something strange in it. Some sort of weird wireless module. We'd like you "
"to do a deep scan of the nearby Collective systems to see if you can pick up "
"any strange wireless communications.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec01.lua:55
msgid ""
"This will be a dangerous mission, because you'll need to stay in the system "
"long enough for the scan to complete. I recommend a fast ship to outrun the "
"drones. Are you interested in doing this now?\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec01.lua:66
msgid ""
"\"You need to jump to each of the systems indicated on your map, and stay in "
"the system until the scan finishes. If you jump out prematurely, you'll have "
"to restart the scan from scratch when you return.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec01.lua:67
msgid ""
"\"Of course, we're not sending you in unprepared. I have updated your ship's "
"computer with a map of the Collective systems, at least the part we know "
"about. I'm afraid it's not very complete intel, but it should be enough.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec01.lua:68
msgid ""
"\"Like I said, it's best if you tried to avoid the drones, but if you think "
"you can take them, go for it! Good luck.\""
msgstr ""

