msgid ""
"You see Commodore Keer with a dozen soldiers waiting for you outside the "
"landing pad."
msgstr ""

#. Successfully killed
#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec05.lua:350
msgid ""
"\"Congratulations on the success, {player}. We never really expected to take "
"Zakred alive. Good riddance. The next step is to begin an all-out attack on "
"Collective territory. Meet up in the bar when you're ready. We'll need all "
"available pilots.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec05.lua:353
msgid ""
"You successfully killed Zakred (a Collective spy) and destroyed the ESS "
"Trinity. Commodore Keer told you to meet her again at the bar on {pnt} for "
"an all-out attack on Collective territory."
msgstr ""

#. Failure to kill
#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec05.lua:359
msgid ""
"\"You weren't supposed to let the Trinity get away! Now we have no cards to "
"play. We must wait for the Collective response or new information before "
"being able to continue. We'll notify you if we have something you can do for "
"us, but for now we just wait.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec05.lua:363
msgid ""
"You failed to destroy the ESS Trinity, putting a hitch in the Empire's "
"plans. You should meet back with Commodore Keer at the bar on {pnt}; she "
"said that they would notify you if they have something more that you can do."
msgstr ""

#. Trinity hooks
#. Got killed
#: dat/missions/empire/collective/ec05.lua:383
msgid "Mission success; return to base."
msgstr ""

