msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/neutral/new_europe_refugees.lua:25
msgid ""
"Nebula refugees want you to get them off world to {spob} in the {sys} "
"system.\n"
"\n"
"#nCargo:#0 as many refugees as you can carry\n"
"{jumps}"
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/neutral/new_europe_refugees.lua:31
