"or alive. Any citizen who can find and neutralize {plt} by any means "
"necessary will be given {credits} as a reward. {paying_faction} authorities "
"have lost track of this pilot in the {sys} system. It is very likely that "
"the target is no longer there, but that system may be a good place to start "
"an investigation.\n"
