#.
#. Introductory mission to the pirate hits, opens up the generic version of the
#. missions.
#. --
#. Forward-declared functions
#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:197
#: dat/missions/pirate/pir_hit_intro.lua:59
msgid "Shady Individual"
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:203
msgid "You see a shady individual, maybe they know something about {spob}?"
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:213
msgid ""
"You land on {spob}, which strikes you as a surprisingly normal-looking "
"world. If you didn't know that it was the centre of the operations of the "
"Raven Pirate Clan, you would have thought it was just a regular trade world."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:216
msgid ""
"You get off your ship with Lucas, whose eyes are sparkling with hopes and "
"dreams."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:217
msgid "\"{spob} at last! I can almost taste the freedom!\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:219
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for all your help getting me here! Here, let me give you some "
"credits for your troubles.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:225
msgid ""
"Lucas seems euphoric to get away from the troubles of his past and begin "
"anew. The question that remains unanswered is whether pirate society is "
"truly more free than other societies. Or is the problem at the core of human "
"nature itself?"
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:226
msgid ""
"You wish him the best, and he tells you to look for him next time you are "
"near Raven space."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:241
msgid ""
"You approach the shady character, who clearly wants you gone, and make idle "
"conversation in hopes of drawing out information about {spob}."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:243
msgid ""
"The character is less than cooperative and seems more interested in shaking "
"you off than helping. It's an exercise in futility."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:244
msgid ""
"Eventually they start ignoring you and leave. Given the amount of people and "
"security on the station, there's not much you can do."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:246
msgid ""
"You look around, but the people here don't seem eager to help. You'll have "
"to find another way to get the information."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:249
msgid ""
"You meet up with Lucas, who also tried to get the information independently, "
"with the same lack of success."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:250
msgid ""
"He lets out a long sigh.\n"
"\"It doesn't look like we're getting anywhere.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:252
msgid ""
"His eyes suddenly light up.\n"
"\"Maybe it's a long shot, but the best way to become a pirate is probably to "
"pirate, is it not?\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:254
msgid ""
"\"We should try to get on a pirate ship and parley as the pirates do. I "
"don't think Marauder ships will know anything, so we should try to board a "
"true pirate ship.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:255
msgid ""
"With the next plan of action decided, Lucas heads back to your ship with his "
"head full of dreams of piracy."
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:269
msgid "Obtain information about {spob} from boarding pirate ships"
msgstr ""

#. Not marauders
#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:296
msgid "Explore Qorel Tunnel and find your way to {spob}."
msgstr ""

#. just in case remove all
#. Already set up
#. create a local upvalue so it doesn't reference the global which will be out of scope
#. Done already
#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:320
msgid "Ask about {spob}"
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:328
msgid ""
"You think us pirates will just tell you anything for money? Well, ye're damn "
"right. I'll tell you for a measly {amount}. What do you say?"
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:336
msgid ""
"#rYou do not enough credits.#0\n"
"\"You think I'm going to accept less? Scram poor bum.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:349
msgid "\"Pleasure doing business with ya.\""
msgstr ""

#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:353
msgid "\"Like I'm going to tell you! You better plead for your life, punk!\""
msgstr ""

#. Should run just after the comm stuff is done
#: dat/missions/pirate/lucas/lucas02.lua:378
msgid ""
"You board the ship with Lucas and, through methods you're not proud of, pry "
"out information about a secret jump likely leading to the Qorel tunnel. "
"You're told {spob} is somewhere beyond."
msgstr ""

