#.
#. This is the first mission of the Shark's teeth campaign. The player has to kill a pirate ancestor with a shark.
#.
#. Stages :
#. 0) Way to Ulios in Ingot
#. 1) Taking off from Ulios and going to Toaxis
#. 2) Fight in Toaxis
#. 3) Pirate ran away
#. 4) Pirate was killed
