#. -- Est. reward from Rhu (12 jumps):
#. --  Shaira: 150K - 300K
#. --  Fyrra:  400K - 775K
#. --  Serra:  1.1M - 2.2M
#. --
#. -- Standing bonus:  (numjumps-4)/2, + up to (1+rank) randomly
#. --   0-3 at Eiderdown,  2-5 at distance 8,  4-7 at Rhu
#. --
#. -- All missions can be made in a Fidelity with an afterburner
#. --
#. --
