#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:14
msgid "Cannibal I"
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:16
msgid ""
"The ship is able to cannibalize boarded vessels to restore armour. For every "
"2 points of armour cannibalized, the ship will gain a single point of armour."
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:27
msgid ""
"The ship will lunge at the target enemy and take a huge bite out of it. +"
"{accel_mod}% accel, +{speed_mod}% speed and -{absorb}% damage taken for "
"{duration} seconds or until target ship is bitten. This ship will do {dmg} "
"damage with its current mass ({mass}). Has a {cooldown} second cooldown "
"period."
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:40
msgid "Cannibal II"
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:43
msgid ""
"Cannibalizing boarded ships will now restore 2 points of armour per 3 points "
"of armour cannibalized, and boarding will cause your ship to perform a full "
"cooldown cycle. In addition to that, lunge now provides -{absorb}% damage "
"taken and {heal}% of bitten armour is restored to the ship."
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:55
msgid ""
"Lunge now provides -{absorb}% damage taken and lunge time increased to "
"{lunge_time} seconds. On successful bite, weapon damage is increased by "
"{weapon_damage}% for {bloodlust_duration} seconds."
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:66
msgid "Strong Jaws"
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:69
msgid ""
"Bite damage increased by {bite_damage}%, and {heal}% of bitten armour is "
"restored to the ship."
msgstr ""

#: dat/scripts/bioship/skills.lua:88
msgid ""
"The ship is able to generate an overflow of adrenaline from energy, allowing "
"for accelerated motion for a short time."
msgstr ""

